    "textPreview": "Don't believe me? Have you seen the president of El Salvador trolling the International Monetary Fund (IMF) on Twitter? He's taunting them, telling them he's \"buying the dip . \" I tweeted President Nayib Bukele when he announced he was going to tap his nation's volcanoes to mine $1 billion in bitcoin \u2014 that he should sell billions worth of future bitcoin earnings collateralized \u201cVolcano Bonds\u201d to pay off the IMF loan and get rid of those leeches. I tagged Mike Novogratz in the tweet, figuring he could sell a bunch to his Wall Street crony pals, but so far he hasn't moved on it. I don't really trust that guy. Maybe because he's a shitcoiner at heart.",
